<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Another tournament, Captain.
<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: March has been full of cricket.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: This one has better teams—some boys from the school league are playing.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: School league boys? They have proper coaching.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Confident">>
Ramu: And you have proper practice—different paths, same game, so don't make them bigger in your mind.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Prize money?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Decent, enough for groceries if we win, but we're playing for form, not funds.

